1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:08,630
Long ago, in the highlands of
Ethiopia, a king dreamed a great dream.

2
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:18,070
His name was King Lalibela. He set out
to build a new Jerusalem in Ethiopia.

3
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:28,490
The churches would not be built from
stones, but carved from a single rock.

4
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:38,480
With great skill and patience, carvers
turned the mountain into wonders.

5
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:48,680
Eleven rock-hewn churches emerged,
one of the wonders of the world.

6
00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:57,720
Among them, Bete Giyorgis, carved deep
into the earth in the shape of a cross.

7
00:01:00,300 --> 00:01:09,080
Centuries later, they remain places
of prayer, pilgrimage and faith.

8
00:01:10,300 --> 00:01:20,660
Lalibela shows the world Ethiopia's
history, faith and heritage.

9
00:01:21,700 --> 00:01:24,400
